namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamLayerStyleBlending {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamLayerStylePreset.h#DreamLayerStyleBlending
    src   "A layer's blend mode and opacity, as an image editor's style keeps them when it includes the layer's blending options."
    text  "图层的混合模式和不透明度，与图像编辑器的样式在包含图层混合选项时所保留的一致。"
    state machine
}

