DreamLayerStylePreset {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamLayerStylePreset.h#DreamLayerStylePreset
    src   "A layer style kept as an asset: an image editor's styles panel, for a project's shared looks -- a button's bevel, a title's\nglow. A layer style that names it as its preset draws it, and follows every edit of it (OnStyleChanged).\n\nIt can keep the layer's blending too (bIncludeBlending): applying the preset to a widget -- from the designer's preset\nlibrary -- then also sets the widget's blend mode and opacity, once. A layer style following the preset only ever draws\nits effects."
    text  "作为资产保存的图层样式：相当于图像编辑器的样式面板，用于项目的共享外观——按钮的斜面、标题的\n发光。以它为预设的图层样式会绘制它，并跟随对它的每一次编辑（OnStyleChanged）。\n\n它也可以保留图层的混合（bIncludeBlending）：从设计器的预设\n库将预设应用到控件时，还会一并设置该控件的混合模式和不透明度，仅此一次。跟随该预设的图层样式只绘制\n其效果。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayerStylePreset:bIncludeBlending {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamLayerStylePreset.h#DreamLayerStylePreset:bIncludeBlending
    src   "Whether applying the preset also sets the widget's blend mode and opacity (Blending)."
    text  "应用预设时是否也设置控件的混合模式和不透明度（Blending）。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayerStylePreset:SetBlending {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamLayerStylePreset.h#DreamLayerStylePreset:SetBlending
    src   "Keep the layer's blending with the style, or stop keeping it."
    text  "保留图层随样式保存的混合，或停止保留。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayerStylePreset:SetStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamLayerStylePreset.h#DreamLayerStylePreset:SetStyle
    src   "Replace the style, and tell every layer style drawing it."
    text  "替换样式，并通知每个绘制它的图层样式。"
    state machine
}

